/// A Memory handle the dispatch has validated, paired with its rights and the
/// region slot it names (spec §2.5).
///
/// The wrapper makes "this handle resolved to a Memory" a type rather than a
/// comment; `process_create` relies on that for the two regions it is handed,
/// even though that op spends no right.
